== Explain Query ==

=== residual filter on another column rides every lookup ===
== Query ==
SELECT id, v FROM t_pk1 WHERE id IN (1, 2, 3, 4, 5) AND v > 25;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Explain Query ==

=== an equality on the IN column after the list is a residual ===
== Query ==
SELECT id, v FROM t_pk1 WHERE id IN (1, 2, 3) AND id = 2;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

== Diff ==
==========



== Explain Query ==

=== an equality before the list binds first; the list is the residual ===
== Query ==
SELECT id, v FROM t_pk1 WHERE id = 2 AND id IN (1, 2, 3);

Number of output lines, including header: 2

