==========



== Explain Query ==

=== composite PK: equality on a, list on b ===
== Query ==
SELECT a, b, v FROM t_pk2 WHERE a = 2 AND b IN (1, 3, 5);

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Explain Query ==

=== composite PK: list on a, equality on b ===
== Query ==
SELECT a, b, v FROM t_pk2 WHERE b = 4 AND a IN (5, 1);

